# Needs a test build (make TEST=1) or the simulator: the synthetic camera.
# Made from tests/signer/signer.txt.in by tests/signer/make_scenario.py.
# The Signer (apps/signer): the transaction first, then the keys. Each PSBT
# is seen with its change only claimed, then checked once the keys are in.
# The key is the BIP-39 test phrase "abandon ... about" (entropy: 16 zero
# bytes; public, no real funds), split 2-of-3 with identifier ZGSQ. Electrum's
# PSBTs are Electrum 4.8.3's own QR codes (tests/signer/electrum.json): the
# signed transactions must hash as Electrum's own (SHA-256 shown, first 8
# bytes). The others come from tests/signer/run_node.mjs --made-out.
# The log holds no share, word or key: only counts, sizes and hashes.
expect Keyboard attached 60
expect launcher ready 60
tile signer
expect signer ready 10
expect signer selftest: 4 passed, 0 failed 30
wait 0.5
shot 01-home

# 1. A watch-only wallet's PSBT (Electrum knows only the account's
# fingerprint): Scan, Review (claimed), Keys, Review (checked), Sign
mark
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @electrum1@
expect signer: read a PSBT \(base43, 608 characters 15
expect signer: review: 2 inputs, 0 to sign, 3 outputs 5
expect signer: change: 1 claimed, 0 checked, 0 stray, 0 unverified, 0 refuted 5
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 02-review-claimed
key ret
wait 0.3
shot 03-keys-empty
key ret
wait 0.3
# share A, then share C, grouped as on paper
type ms12zgsqa40sgqvwltnun3f8drxxujvljm648z42my97v2h0
key ret
type MS12 ZGSQ CADP 5Q7M V8JL JHZE GN00 LY7V YXSZ CJRW FVJA X6ZD
key ret
wait 0.3
shot 04-shares
# Enter in the empty passphrase: load
mark
key ret
expect signer: key loaded \(bip39, 2 shares\) 30
wait 0.5
shot 05-keys-loaded
mark
key ret
expect signer: review: 2 inputs, 2 to sign, 3 outputs 5
expect signer: change: 0 claimed, 1 checked, 0 stray, 0 unverified, 0 refuted 5
wait 0.5
shot 06-review-checked
mark
key ret
expect signer: signed 2 inputs, transaction complete \(SHA-256 dd31fe69d7368962\) 30
wait 0.5
shot 07-signed
# Done, Next transaction, Show as PSBT
key tab
key tab
mark
key ret
expect signer: showing the signed psbt 10
wait 0.5
shot 08-signed-psbt

# 2. Next transaction (keep keys): a seed wallet's PSBT on testnet
# (master fingerprint 73c5da0a, full paths)
key tab
mark
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @electrum2@
expect signer: read a PSBT \(base43, 612 characters 15
expect signer: review: 2 inputs, 2 to sign 5
camera scene
mark
key ret
expect signer: signed 2 inputs, transaction complete \(SHA-256 0baf3b76d1d92827\) 30
wait 0.3
key tab
key ret
wait 0.3

# 3. P2PKH from a QR code: Electrum leaves out the previous transaction, so
# nothing can be signed
mark
camera qr @electrum3@
expect signer: read a PSBT \(base43, 420 characters 15
expect signer: review: 1 input, 0 to sign 5
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 09-p2pkh-refused
key esc
wait 0.3

# 4. Change that is ours, at a path the wallet never scans: amber, counted as sent
mark
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @stray@
expect signer: review: 2 inputs, 2 to sign 15
expect signer: change: 0 claimed, 0 checked, 1 stray, 0 unverified, 0 refuted 5
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 10-stray
key esc
wait 0.3

# 5. Change the PSBT claims, paying an attacker's key: red, and signing asks
mark
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @refuted@
expect signer: review: 2 inputs, 2 to sign 15
expect signer: change: 0 claimed, 0 checked, 0 stray, 0 unverified, 1 refuted 5
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 11-refuted
key ret
wait 0.5
shot 12-sign-anyway
# "Don't sign" has the focus
key ret
wait 0.3
key esc
wait 0.3

# 6. Forget the keys (Scan, Last transaction, Public key, Forget)
key tab
key tab
key tab
mark
key ret
expect signer: keys forgotten 5
wait 0.5
shot 13-forgotten

# 7. The same PSBT seen first, claimed; then with a key that can't check it
mark
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @refuted@
expect signer: change: 1 claimed, 0 checked, 0 stray, 0 unverified, 0 refuted 15
camera scene
wait 0.3
# Load the keys, xprv or WIF: a single key
key ret
wait 0.3
key tab
key tab
key ret
wait 0.3
type notakey
mark
key ret
expect signer: private key refused 5
wait 0.3
shot 14-key-refused
@backspaces@
type @wif0@
mark
key ret
expect signer: key loaded \(wif\) 10
wait 0.5
shot 15-keys-wif
mark
key ret
expect signer: review: 2 inputs, 1 to sign 5
expect signer: change: 0 claimed, 0 checked, 0 stray, 1 unverified, 0 refuted 5
wait 0.5
shot 16-unverified
# 8. Partly signed: one key of two, then done, and the keys go
mark
key ret
wait 0.5
expect signer: signed 1 input 15
expect signer: showing the signed psbt 10
wait 0.3
shot 17-partly-signed
mark
key ret
expect signer: keys forgotten 5
wait 0.3

# 9. Merge two half-signed copies: complete with no key loaded
mark
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @half0@
expect signer: review: 2 inputs, 0 to sign 15
camera scene
wait 0.3
# Load the keys, Merge a copy
key tab
mark
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @other@
expect signer: refused a code: That is a different transaction 15
mark
camera qr @half1@
expect signer: merged a copy \(base43, 1 new field\) 15
expect signer: review: 2 inputs, 0 to sign 5
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 18-merged
mark
key ret
expect signer: signed 0 inputs, transaction complete 10
expect signer: showing the signed tx 10
wait 0.3
shot 19-merged-signed
key ret
wait 0.3

# 10. A finished transaction is only shown
mark
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @finished@
expect signer: read a finished transaction 15
expect signer: finished transaction: 2 inputs, 2 outputs 5
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 20-finished
key esc
wait 0.3

# 11. Seed words, a word wrong then right, signing with the account's tprv too
mark
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @plain@
expect signer: change: 1 claimed 15
camera scene
wait 0.3
key ret
wait 0.3
key tab
key ret
wait 0.3
type abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abouz
wait 0.3
# Tab to the passphrase; Enter there loads
key tab
mark
key ret
expect signer: words refused 5
wait 0.3
shot 21-words-refused
key shift-tab
key backspace
type t
key tab
mark
key ret
expect signer: key loaded \(seed words\) 15
wait 0.5
key tab
key tab
key tab
key ret
wait 0.3
type @accountTprv@
mark
key ret
expect signer: key loaded \(xprv\) 10
wait 0.5
shot 22-two-keys
mark
key ret
expect signer: review: 2 inputs, 2 to sign 5
expect signer: change: 0 claimed, 1 checked, 0 stray, 0 unverified, 0 refuted 5
mark
key ret
expect signer: signed 2 inputs, transaction complete 15
wait 0.3
# Escape is Done: the keys go
mark
key esc
expect signer: keys forgotten 5
wait 0.3

# 12. The public key for Electrum needs a master key (Scan, Public key)
key tab
key ret
wait 0.3
key tab
key tab
key ret
wait 0.3
type @xprv@
mark
key ret
expect signer: key loaded \(xprv\) 10
expect signer: showing the p2wpkh public key \(mainnet\), account 0, descriptor, 1\d\d characters 10
wait 0.5
shot 23-descriptor
# the form's dropdown: Electrum's zpub
mark
key tab
key ret
key down
key ret
expect signer: showing the p2wpkh public key \(mainnet\), account 0, extended key, 111 characters 10
wait 0.5
shot 23-zpub
key esc
wait 0.3

