# 16. An animated PSBT, too big for one of Electrum's codes: its parts in turn,
# a code of another file refused on the way, then the summary. Escape on the
# signed page forgets the keys
mark
key esc
expect signer: keys forgotten 5
wait 0.3
key ret
wait 0.3
mark
camera qr @big0@
expect signer: BBQr part: 1 of @bigparts@ 15
mark
camera qr @otherSeries@
expect signer: refused a code: That code is from another series 15
wait 0.3
shot 27-series-refused
@bigrest@
mark
camera qr @biglast@
expect signer: read a PSBT \(BBQr, \d+ characters, \d+ bytes\) 15
expect signer: review: 12 inputs, 0 to sign, 2 outputs 5
expect signer: change: 1 claimed 5
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 28-bbqr-read
